OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FBreezy with
OL,6,Fshowers, mostly across the Pennines,
OL,7,Fclear spells elsewhere. Clouding over
OL,8,Flater, with light rain across western
OL,9,Fparts by Monday morning. The wind
OL,10,Fgradually eases to a gentle breeze.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FCloudy, with rain affecting
OL,13,Fmost places by mid-morning. The bulk
OL,14,Fof the rain clears during the
OL,15,Fafternoon, with clear spells
OL,16,Fdeveloping by the evening. Turning
OL,17,Fbreezy in the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
