OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,6,FRemaining breezy, with showers
OL,7,Faffecting some on Tuesday and
OL,8,FWednesday. Turning increasingly
OL,9,Fsettled, with lighter winds by
OL,10,FThursday.
